    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/dog-groomer/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Dog Groomer Theme is a professional, SEO-friendly, and fully responsive template created for dog grooming salons, pet care businesses, pet spas, dog stylists, pet groomers, animal care centers, dog boarding facilities, mobile grooming services, and pet boutique owners looking to build an engaging online presence. Perfect for showcasing grooming services like dog bathing, haircuts, trimming, nail clipping, ear cleaning, flea treatments, puppy grooming, deshedding, fur styling, and full-service pet grooming, this theme ensures pet owners can easily find, explore, and book your services. It supports detailed service pages for dog spa packages, pet hygiene care, mobile dog grooming, and personalized pet styling sessions. With integrated booking systems such as Bookly and Contact Form 7, clients can conveniently schedule appointments and send inquiries online. The clean and modern layout highlights service galleries, before-and-after images, client testimonials, and pricing tables, helping establish credibility and trust. Built with responsive design and optimized performance, it delivers a smooth browsing experience on all devices. The theme’s built-in SEO optimization improves visibility for search terms like “dog grooming near me,” “pet salon,” and “professional dog stylist,” while social media integration boosts engagement and reach. Customization options for colors, typography, and layout make it easy to reflect your unique brand identity. Compatible with WooCommerce, the theme also supports selling pet accessories, grooming products, pet shampoos, and treats directly from your store. Whether you run a mobile pet spa, a luxury dog salon, or an independent pet grooming business, the Dog Groomer Theme provides a complete, high-performing, and visually engaging solution to grow your online presence and attract loyal pet-loving customers."
    },
